ity controls are not included in Section IV of this report. \\nAdobe uses subservice organizations to perform certain services. A list of these subservice organizations and the \\nservices performed is provided in the following table. The description does not disclose the actual controls at the \\nsubservice organizations. \\nSubservice Organization \\nServices Performed \\nAmazon Web Services, Inc. (AWS) \\nProvides infrastructure as a service through its AWS platform. \\nMicrosoft Corporation (Mi", "confidence_justification": ["+0.4: in common subservice orgs list", "+0.1: likely_so is Yes", "+0.1: common_so is Yes", "GPT-4o review failed: Expecting value: line 1 column 1 (char 0) | Response: \'```json\\\\n{\\\\n  \\"is_likely_subservice_org\\": true,\\\\n  \\"reason\\": \\"Equinix, as a colocation provider, offers physical security and environmental controls for data centers, which are critical components of the infrastructure services that can impact the system\\\\\'s security, availability, and confidentiality. Therefore, it is likely to be identified as a subservice organization in a SOC 2 report.\\"\\\\n}\\\\n```\'"]}, {"third_party_name": "Google Cloud Platform", "third_party_description": "Google Cloud Platform is a suite of cloud computing services that runs on the same infrastructure that Google uses internally for its end-user products.", "third_party_page_ref": "https://cloud.google.com/,PAGE 19,PAGE 19", "third_party_confidence": 0.9, "distance_from_so_keywords": 0, "likely_so": "Yes", "common_so": "Yes", "third_party_controls": [{"third_party_control_seq": 1, "third_party_control_id": null, "third_party_control_desc": null}, {"third_party_control_seq": 1, "third_party_control_id": null, "third_party_control_desc": null}, {"third_party_control_seq": 2, "third_party_control_id": null, "third_party_control_desc": null}, {"third_party_control_seq": 3, "third_party_control_id": null, "third_party_control_desc": null}], "source_context": "ncluding updates a