 physical security and environmental controls for data centers, which are critical components of the infrastructure services that can impact the system\\\\\'s security, availability, and confidentiality. Therefore, it is likely to be identified as a subservice organization in a SOC 2 report.\\"\\\\n}\\\\n```\'"]', None]
