2025-07-24 04:16:19,744 INFO: SQL: INSERT INTO subservice_org (name, confidence, scan_id, third_party_description, third_party_page_ref, third_party_confidence, distance_from_so_keywords, likely_so, common_so, source_context, confidence_justification, third_party_controls) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING | Values: ['GitLab', 0.9, 18, 'Source code management platform for Git repositories and code deployment tool', 'Page 21,s.', 0.9, 3, 'Yes', 'Yes', 'ribe to a defined physical and environmental security model. \nSoftware \nAdobe Management has a focus on scaling software solutions to efficiently support Adobe’s Experience Cloud \noperational environment. The following key systems and applications are leveraged to support Adobe’s Experience \nCloud core solutions: \nApplication \nDescription \nChange Management \nGitHub Enterprise \nGitHub is a centralized source code control system. It is implemented internally for the \nmanagement of code repositories. \nGitLab \n(Workfront only) GitLab is a source code management platform for Git repositories, as well \nas a code deployment tool used for production environments \nService Knowledge \nManagement System \n(SKMS) \nSKMS is an internally developed set of tools, information, and systems that govern change \nand support Adobe technical operations.  \nJenkins \nJenkins is an open-source continuous integration tool for dissemination of builds and \nchange management controls for the production environment. Je', '["Filtered by GPT: This is a software service offering for source code management and deployment.", "+0.4: in common subservice orgs list", "+0.1: likely_so is Yes", "+0.1: common_so is Yes", "GPT-4o review failed: Expecting value: line 1 column 1 (char 0) | Response: \'```json\\\\n{\\\\n  \\"is_likely_subservice_org\\": true,\\\\n  \\"reason\\": \\"GitLab, as a source code management platform and code deployment tool, can be considered a subservice organization in a SOC 2 report if it is used by the primary service organization to manage and deploy code that is part of the services provided to customers. This is because it plays a role in the operational processes that could impact the security, availability, or confidentiality of the services offered.\\"\\\\n}\\\\n```\'"]', '[{"third_party_control_seq": 1, "third_party_control_id": null, "third_party_control_desc": null}]']
