form a significant part of the services provided to customers, such as data centers or cloud service providers. Atlassian\\\\\'s products are more likely to be categorized as third-party software rather than subservice organizations in a SOC 2 report.\\"\\\\n}\\\\n```\'"]', '[{"third_party_control_seq": 1, "third_party_control_id": null, "third_party_control_desc": null}, {"third_party_control_seq": 1, "third_party_control_id": null, "third_party_control_desc": "Initiation of major software releases with a Jira ticket."}, {"third_party_control_seq": 2, "third_party_control_id": null, "third_party_control_desc": "Continuous referencing and updating of Jira ticket during SLC process."}]']
